    "The four cohorts are separate measured populations; no pooled universal accuracy is claimed.",
    "Paired/triplet texts within a connected group are dependent. Bootstrap resamples whole groups, not independent rows.",
    "The two rewrite views share the same 600 human controls and overlap their parent cohort; never add their counts or treat their intervals as independent.",
    "Intervals use 500 replicates, seed42 and fixed selected predictions/calibration. They exclude training, model-selection and calibration uncertainty; zero observed errors can create degenerate intervals.",
    "Acceptance is prespecified point-criterion passage, not CI endpoint passage or a population/per-domain 1% FPR guarantee.",
    "All these final rows are >=128 word-like units; no short-text or non-English detection accuracy is established.",
    "Binary success does not validate source-family/version authentication; rankings remain exploratory.",
    "No Linux/CUDA/ZeroGPU deployment parity is implied by the original macOS CPU/MPS engineering checks."
